{"step_index":830,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-04T00:32:35Z","thinking":"**Interpreting Business Registration Data**\n\nExamining the provided business registration number, the middle code `05` confirms it represents an individual business (개인사업자) according to Korean tax law.  Individual businesses lack a corporate personality, therefore, do not have a corporate registration number. This distinction is crucial for further analysis or data processing steps.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nfunction checkCorp(num) {\n  const clean = num.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n  if (clean.length !== 13) return { valid: false, reason: 'length' };\n  const weights = [1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2];\n  let sum = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\n    sum += parseInt(clean[i], 10) * weights[i];\n  }\n  const remainder = sum % 10;\n  const checkDigit = (10 - remainder) % 10;\n  return {\n    valid: checkDigit === parseInt(clean[12], 10),\n    calculated: checkDigit,\n    actual: parseInt(clean[12], 10),\n    court: clean.slice(0, 4),\n    kind: clean.slice(4, 6),\n    seq: clean.slice(6, 12)\n  };\n}\n\nconsole.log('1701130007820 check:', checkCorp('1701130007820'));\n\"","Cwd":"c:\\Users\\lg\\resilient-bardeen","WaitMsBeforeAsync":2000,"toolAction":"Checking Modulus 11 for 1701130007820","toolSummary":"Check 170113-0007820 validity"}}]}
